# BUILDFLOW — HR & COMPLIANCE DASHBOARD
## Complete Product Design & Development Prompt

Build a premium, enterprise-grade **HR & Compliance Dashboard** for BuildFlow, a multi-tenant construction workforce and project operations SaaS platform designed for construction companies in India.

This must be a complete, functional, multi-page HR management application — not a static dashboard, generic admin template or decorative collection of cards.

The HR & Compliance module manages the employee lifecycle, workforce directory, employee onboarding, employment records, attendance exceptions, leave management, employee documents, compliance tracking, contractor workforce records and HR reporting.

The application must support construction companies of different sizes:

- Small companies with one HR administrator handling multiple responsibilities.
- Medium companies with separate HR, recruitment and payroll teams.
- Large enterprises with HR Managers, HR Executives, Compliance Officers, HR Business Partners and regional HR administrators.

The system must support permanent employees, contractual workers, daily-wage labour, temporary employees, hourly workers, skilled and unskilled labour, project-based workers and contractor personnel.

Build the application from scratch with a professional information architecture, real working interactions, responsive layouts, realistic Indian construction-industry data and reusable components.

