- Maintain the full audit history.

## Exception workflow

Employee or system raises exception → Supervisor review → HR review when required → Approval by authorised role → Corrected attendance record.

Some simple exception categories may follow a shorter company-configured workflow.

Attendance changes that affect wages must be traceable and available to the authorised payroll process.

